window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>To save the Earth from utter ruin, I must find a way back into Heaven . . . and kill an Archangel.</p> <p>The brutal Archangel who beat me so hard I fell from Heaven has a foothold on Earth, and this time he's gone too far. I crave vengeance, and I won't be denied, but I may need him alive if I have any chance at fixing the damage God left in the wake of Her death.</p> <p>Faith and Damnation is the second book in a dark, and exciting enemies-to-lovers fantasy romance. If you want to get lost in an edgy universe where God is dead and Her angels are the bad guys, sink your teeth into this!</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
